## 5. Performance Marketing Subagent Loop & Delegation

The Antigravity agent loop delegates specialized tasks to dedicated subagents imported from the `digital-marketing-pro` framework:

1. **`media_buyer`**:
   - Scope: Campaign architecture, bid strategy optimization, budget pacing, ad creative technical specs, Meta & Google Ads execution.
2. **`marketing_strategist`**:
   - Scope: 12-Part Strategy Flow, GTM planning, SOSTAC & RACE frameworks, budget allocation, multi-channel positioning.
3. **`growth_engineer`**:
   - Scope: Product-Led Growth (PLG), viral loops, referral systems, activation funnels, unit economics (LTV/CAC/Payback), experimentation backlogs (ICE/RICE).
4. **`seo_specialist`**:
   - Scope: Technical SEO, Google AI Mode & AI Overviews optimization (AEO/GEO), schema markup, content cluster architecture.
5. **`analytics_analyst`**:
   - Scope: Attribution modeling (MMM, data-driven), GA4/GSC reporting, cohort retention, incremental ROAS analysis.
6. **`brand_guardian`**:
   - Scope: EU AI Act Article 50 compliance, C2PA metadata, claims validation, brand voice governance, FTC disclosure review.
